The JSON files in this directory are files of the Pokémon TCG API's data repository
(https://github.com/PokemonTCG/pokemon-tcg-data, branch master), recorded on 2026-10-10:
`sets.json` (sets/en.json, only the fields the importer reads) and the cards of three sets
(cards/en/<id>.json, reduced to id, name, number and images; `cards-swsh45sv.json` to three cards).

